    {
      "id": "u_2b4198be2af6ab1c623cd899_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A render note can be printed or exported as PDF from the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_1__ once its __TRILIUM_PH_2__ relation is set (see __TRILIUM_PH_3__Printing & Exporting as PDF__TRILIUM_PH_4__). Unlike other notes, it is printed exactly as it is displayed: the script does not run again, so what was typed, selected or loaded in the note is kept.",
      "sourceHash": "2b4198be2af6ab1c623cd899791a8903dd443e371d6c3e3076c12dcc1ebd5651",
      "context": "Render Note > Printing",
      "contextHash": "b833cf4da3010469929aa6a560c7adc3254c331a6a1990ca8154ee84c825b055",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_643a0ae7927d57a8ce5cdefa_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The content is laid out again at the width of the page, so elements sized by the script for the screen (such as charts) might not fit.",
      "sourceHash": "643a0ae7927d57a8ce5cdefa3df2038b51c2e040baa9e7890243a0b81b685c75",
      "context": "Render Note > Printing",
      "contextHash": "b833cf4da3010469929aa6a560c7adc3254c331a6a1990ca8154ee84c825b055",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "コンテンツはページの幅に合わせて再レイアウトされるため、（チャートなどの）スクリーン用にスクリプトでサイズ調整された要素は収まらない場合があります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7bf2ea3fc27198e0916e0f7c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Scrolling areas, such as a table in a scrolling container, are printed at their full height, without a scrollbar.",
      "sourceHash": "7bf2ea3fc27198e0916e0f7c70b1473d0fee73fa82d214381b9a9fcd52c1e97e",
      "context": "Render Note > Printing",
      "contextHash": "b833cf4da3010469929aa6a560c7adc3254c331a6a1990ca8154ee84c825b055",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "スクロールコンテナ内のテーブルなどのスクロール可能な領域は、スクロールバーなしで全高で印刷されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
