      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When a render note is printed as part of a __TRILIUM_PH_0__List View__TRILIUM_PH_1__ collection, or from another view such as its attachments, it is not on screen, so its script runs again for the print. In a collection, the output is printed without the note's own styles.",
